WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:08.110
It's all right! Now let's move forward

3
00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:11.590
with the sun always in our hearts

4
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.030
As power passes through our clasped hands

5
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.680
Let's grab hold of our wishes

6
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:32.510
Working together, let's ride the giant waves

7
00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:40.330
Let's hurry toward the excitement--
there's the starting signal

8
00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:47.140
Now's the time to set sail-- let's raise anchor

9
00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:55.000
Cut through the rainbow-colored wind
and head for a sea of adventure

10
00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:58.570
It'll be a journey fraught with injury

11
00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:02.300
but what you cherish most will be right there

12
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.430
And if you get into a jam

13
00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:08.380
I'll always be there to protect you

14
00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:13.360
It's all right! Now let's move forward

15
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
with the sun always in our hearts

16
00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:20.350
If a storm hits, let's put
our arms around each other

17
00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:24.230
and gaze at the light beyond

18
00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:27.970
If we gather up the pieces of our dreams

19
00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:31.580
they'll make a map leading to tomorrow

20
00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.750
So let's grab hold of our wishes

21
00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:40.480
under the same flag-- together, we're one

22
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:55.000
<b>Groggy Ring!!</b>

23
00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:55.550
Our mighty Groggy Ring
combatants have taken the field!

24
00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:56.930
Opposing them...

25
00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:00.350
...is the violent cook who kicked
the interference squads'

26
00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:02.770
butt in Round One; Sanji!

27
00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:04.770
That's "first-rate cook."

28
00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:12.180
And the pirate hunter with a bounty
of 60 million; Roronoa Zoro!

29
00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:16.310
This is what they called us
out here for? What a laugh!

30
00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:18.540
Right Big Pan?

31
00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.080
Huh?

32
00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:24.060
He can't hear ya.

33
00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.740
What's with these guys?

34
00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:27.900
We'll start with a coin toss.

35
00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:31.010
Tails.

36
00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.060
Tails.

37
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.430
Field or ball?

38
00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:36.600
Ball.

39
00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:39.940
Our Groggy Monsters have chosen the ball!

40
00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.240
The Straw Hat ball man will
enter the other team's mid-circle!

41
00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:45.000
Which side do you want?

42
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:45.970
Doesn't matter.

43
00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:49.810
During the game there are two
"ball men" with a ball on their heads!

44
00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:53.940
Knock your opponent's ball man into your opponent's ring and you win!

45
00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.590
Just get on with it!

46
00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:59.140
Get in position ball man!

47
00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:00.160
Hey now.

48
00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.730
I don't care how pushy you are.

49
00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:06.500
I still ain't gonna be the damn ball.

50
00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.800
I refuse to wear this stupid thing!

51
00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:10.600
Quit your whining!

52
00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.800
Oh! Looks good on you!

53
00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.540
I won't fall for that moron!

54
00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:20.470
Zoro! Sanji! It's up to you guys!

55
00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:24.300
Win Chopper back! We can't lose now!

56
00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.290
I'm really sorry! We're counting on you!

57
00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:29.980
Whoa a wotan... I've never seen one before!

58
00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:33.400
I guess they're not as large
as pureblooded giants.

59
00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.530
Cheer them on all you
want; it's still no use!

60
00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:42.250
Everyone on our team is a Groggy Ring expert!

61
00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.670
What do you want Split-Head?

62
00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.900
He said it again...

63
00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:51.840
Oh, Boss!

64
00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:55.500
Now quit doing that Straw Hat!

65
00:03:57.430 --> 00:04:01.280
I doubt I'll need to interfere with this game,

66
00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.470
so I thought I'd watch too.

67
00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.840
Got a problem with that?

68
00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.050
Interference is allowed with this game too?!

69
00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.960
Imbecile! It's allowed for every game!

70
00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:14.400
It's just some people will stoop to anything to help their team win

71
00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:17.640
while others might insist on a
fair-and-square contest, you know?

72
00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:19.700
So it depends on the situation.

73
00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:25.710
But if you can't even
handle a little interference

74
00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:28.490
how can you hope to survive
as a seafaring pirate?

75
00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.050
It's a question of character.

76
00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:32.820
That's how you justify it?

77
00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:35.440
What's with that team of yours anyway?!

78
00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:38.120
If you can even call it a team!

79
00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:42.430
Talk all you want! Once the match starts
you'll see what they can--!

80
00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:45.760
You went too early just now!

81
00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.100
Did not! I win!

82
00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:49.730
At everything.

83
00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.830
Don't be a smartass!

84
00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.350
We're talking about rock-paper-scissors here!

85
00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.680
No you lost!

86
00:04:56.680 --> 00:05:00.050
Just decide on a ball man already!

87
00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.640
They haven't even agreed on that yet...

88
00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:06.030
Sanji-kun! That ball looks nice on you!

89
00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:10.290
I'll do it! I'm the ball man! I'm the worthiest!

90
00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:14.430
It does suit you. You look like a prince.

91
00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.390
Of Moronica.

92
00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.800
Just start the game!

93
00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:26.750
Hold on! Weapons are against the rules! Lose the swords!

94
00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.410
Huh? Really?

95
00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:31.160
Yes this is a ball game!

96
00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:33.750
It wouldn't be much of a game if weapons were allowed!

97
00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:38.250
I'm fine either way to be honest!

98
00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.250
Hey you gonna be okay?

99
00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:42.710
A master swordsman without swords is...

100
00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:43.760
Is what?

101
00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:47.660
...nothing but a worthless wimp.

102
00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:55.270
Knock it off you guys!

103
00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:57.280
All right! It's now or never!

104
00:05:57.280 --> 00:06:01.410
The Straw Hats' ball man Sanji has entered the opponent's circle!

105
00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.920
Hey cook, I hope you get trampled.

106
00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:04.480
Shut up!

107
00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.020
Stomp 'im Big Pan!

108
00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:09.750
The crowd is all fired up!

109
00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:12.950
Big Pan! Let's run-and-gun 'em!

110
00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:16.320
Huh?

111
00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.260
He can't hear ya!

112
00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:22.340
U-Uhh...

113
00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.650
C'mon man...

114
00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.290
Pay attention!

115
00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:37.610
It's not that funny is it?

116
00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:42.610
The Groggy Monsters are as jolly as always!

117
00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:45.780
Let's get this delightful show on the road!

118
00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:49.090
There's no time limit
and the first team to score wins!

119
00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:55.030
So we win if we knock Jumbo's
head into the other ring...

120
00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.920
And we lose if the cook's head
gets knocked into our ring...

121
00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:10.600
Can Team Straw Hat win back
the reindeer they lost in Round One?!

122
00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.140
Crush 'em!

123
00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:16.450
Or will Team Foxy swipe
another crew member?!

124
00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.920
They're about to clash in Groggy Ring!

125
00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:21.200
The whistle is about to sound!

126
00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.280
Let the game begin!

127
00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:34.200
What will ball man Sanji do in enemy territory?!

128
00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:35.970
Will he retreat or attack?!

129
00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.790
Let's do it!

130
00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.870
There goes "Tackle Machine" Pickles!

131
00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:45.180
All right. I'll take care of this myself.

132
00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.510
Sling Tackle!

133
00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.170
I don't care about you!

134
00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.980
I'm only after you!

135
00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:53.690
All we gotta do to win is beat you down!

136
00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.820
It's a ball man battle!

137
00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.390
Collier...!

138
00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:06.400
Wh-What the...?! His skin's all slimy!

139
00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:10.280
Sanji the cook slips and slides
on Big Pan's outstretched arm!

140
00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:12.200
It's only natural though...

141
00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:17.240
...for Big Pan is a slippery-skinned
wotan of loach origin!

142
00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:20.310
What the heck are you doing?!

143
00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.480
Run-and-gun!

144
00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.320
You idiot!

145
00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:26.320
Who are you calling an idiot?!

146
00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.260
Punk Pass!

147
00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:40.230
There it is! Big Pan's super-long pass!

148
00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:42.900
Sanji!

149
00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:47.610
Their leader Hamburg
makes for the landing point!

150
00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:50.340
With Roronoa Zoro racing by his side!

151
00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:53.700
I'll chop you up if they score a goal!

152
00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.510
Shut up! Quit your whining!

153
00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:58.850
Sweeping Tackle!

154
00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.720
Pickles enters enemy territory!

155
00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:05.830
Meanwhile can Hamburg
catch Sanji in the air?!

156
00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.430
Yes! And then...!

157
00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:10.130
Gorilla Throw!

158
00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.840
I got it! I got it!

159
00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.600
Waiting for him now is Pickles!

160
00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:16.870
Get back here! I'll teach you to...!

161
00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:19.430
Roronoa moves to intercept but...!

162
00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:23.020
Spinning Tackle!

163
00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.410
What?!

164
00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:30.880
Ball man Sanji is sent flying skyward too!

165
00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.590
Sanji!

166
00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:36.760
Bringing up the rear is Big Pan!

167
00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.370
He rushes for the falling Hamburg!

168
00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:39.410
Punk Receive!

169
00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:45.600
Hamburg catches Sanji above
enemy territory! Incredible!

170
00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:50.600
They're within range of the ring!

171
00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.610
Stupid Eyebrows!

172
00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.430
Here it comes! The Hamburger Dunk!

173
00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:02.710
Wh-What are you--?!

174
00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:07.120
Zoro! Sanji! Do something!

175
00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.230
Is it about to end already?!

176
00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:11.960
Don't need to tell me...!

177
00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:20.570
I ain't gonna... let 'em score!

178
00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.600
You ain't gonna score!

179
00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:31.980
I'm still in tip-top shape!

180
00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:35.450
I can't let that damn swordsman snub me...

181
00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:37.920
...by saving...

182
00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:40.420
...my hide!

183
00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:50.350
No goal!

184
00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:54.430
It looks like ball man Sanji isn't going
to pass through the goal so easily!

185
00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:01.610
Mind your own damn business!

186
00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.440
You get thrown around too easy idiot!

187
00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:08.930
A duo as powerful as the
Groggy Monsters has appeared!

188
00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.840
We have an epic game on our hands!

189
00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:16.420
This has never happened before!
This is unprecedented!

190
00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.890
These behemoths were sent
flying through the air!

191
00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:24.140
The crowd is stunned! Team Straw Hat is formidable!

192
00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:28.910
I don't need you to give me backup!

193
00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.240
It's only 'cause I can't count on you!

194
00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:33.020
They're amazing!

195
00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.540
They actually threw Pickles!

196
00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.640
They sent Hamburg-san flying!

197
00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:46.720
Who asked for your help?!

198
00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.520
You get tossed around too much!

199
00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:51.460
Oh no! What are you doing Hamburg?!

200
00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.490
Lose and you'll regret it!

201
00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:57.740
Oh but Team Straw Hat is acting strangely!

202
00:11:57.740 --> 00:12:01.260
Although the game is still going
with both ball men in bounds

203
00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.970
the two teammates are
arguing instead of playing!

204
00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:07.040
They're funny!

205
00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.340
Zoro! Sanji! You idiots!

206
00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:11.960
What are you doing?! Now's your chance!

207
00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.810
The other ball man's all alone!

208
00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:16.290
Gang up on him and knock him into the ring!

209
00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.000
Huh?

210
00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:22.920
Big Pan goes in for a surprise attack!

211
00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:26.120
Whoa...!

212
00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:28.920
Too Bad Dance!

213
00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.360
What are you running for?! He's the ball man!

214
00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:39.470
Yeah we know! But hang on, he has blades under his shoes!

215
00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:43.840
Hey, Ref!

216
00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:46.890
What happened to "no weapons allowed"?!

217
00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:57.740
Whoa! Can you be any more blatant?!

218
00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:00.370
If he misses a play it's out of his hands!

219
00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:03.360
Quit screwing around Ref!

220
00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.440
Hold on Sanji-kun!

221
00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:14.530
You saw the whole thing! Why are you sweatin' like a waterfall?!

222
00:13:14.530 --> 00:13:19.640
I-I didn't s-see a th-thing...

223
00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:20.740
Liar!

224
00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:23.180
Hey hold on! He's the ref you know!

225
00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:27.790
Yellow card to Sanji of Team Straw Hat!

226
00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.290
Say what?!

227
00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.790
W-Wait! Wait! Wait!

228
00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:36.800
And there's the yellow warning card!

229
00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:41.200
One more and Sanji the cook
will get a red ejection card!

230
00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:43.370
I'll eject you!

231
00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:48.350
I can't believe he's scummy enough to attack the referee!

232
00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:51.100
Shut up! I oughta knock you off!

233
00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.780
He's a gangster!

234
00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:54.810
We gotta do something about his weapons...

235
00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:57.980
Hold on! You're allowing that now?!

236
00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:01.720
I just happen to be looking away...

237
00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:03.530
Look out there, Ref!

238
00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.430
That idiot's using an axe now! An axe!

239
00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:09.360
No! Stop! You can't afford to get ejected!

240
00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:13.090
Are you kidding me?! I can't let
'em get away with this insanity!

241
00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:15.980
Don't you see?! They want you to get mad!

242
00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:18.140
Pull yourself together!
This is for Chopper's sake!

243
00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:20.390
All right! Then I'll beat him up!

244
00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:23.510
Don't go complicating things!

245
00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:25.810
Sanji-kun! Just beat 'em!

246
00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:27.720
Pose of Love

247
00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:30.610
You don't make any sense...

248
00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:33.660
All right! Back to the game!

249
00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:41.330
You didn't have to start with that again!

250
00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.540
This is gettin' us nowhere!

251
00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:47.530
But we can change our game plan
now that we know they've got weapons!

252
00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:51.200
It's time to take him out!

253
00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:55.070
Stay out of my way! I can handle him myself!

254
00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:58.040
Work together! You're a team you know!

255
00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:01.470
And there they go!
All three are about to collide!

256
00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:09.190
Can't attack where his skin
is exposed! He's too slippery!

257
00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:12.920
That leaves his hands
feet mask and trunks...

258
00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.390
Loach Scooping Slide!

259
00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.120
Crap!

260
00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:20.730
Loach Racing Circus!

261
00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:26.710
There it is! The Racing Circus acrobatics!

262
00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:29.140
Both opponents slide across his wide back!

263
00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:32.580
Ha! Won't work this time!
I can handle a little skating!

264
00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:34.540
Now they can't escape!

265
00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:38.550
So dizzy...!

266
00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:38.550
Come on you guys!

267
00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:42.970
Meanwhile the other two players
have gotten back into the game!

268
00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:46.430
Oh! They're back in it!
Slaughter 'em!

269
00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:49.490
Oh? Their attire is a little different now!

270
00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:54.570
Hamburg, their leader is wearing iron knuckles and iron elbow guards!

271
00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:58.370
Meanwhile Pickles has donned
spiked shoulder protectors!

272
00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.870
These clearly violate the "no weapons" rule!

273
00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:05.340
Oh, but the referee just happens
to have his back turned right now,

274
00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:08.280
as he does some stretches!

275
00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:13.050
Now I'm mad Leader!

276
00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:15.890
Here goes!

277
00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:18.270
Loach Coaster!

278
00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:22.790
Everything's spinning...!

279
00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.060
Let's do it Leader!

280
00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:26.220
Yeah!

281
00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:27.970
Spinning Tackle!

282
00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:30.810
The recovered players counterattack!

283
00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:33.770
But their target isn't the ball man... It's the swordsman Roronoa!

284
00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:35.610
They're sniping him with the iron knuckles!

285
00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:37.740
Hamburger Hammer!

286
00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.320
Zoro!

287
00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:49.090
The attack isn't over yet! Big Pan instantly takes an attack stance!

288
00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:53.890
Hamburg prepares to use
his iron elbow guards!

289
00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:54.520
No way!

290
00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:56.250
It can't be...

291
00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.830
This is truly dangerous! A horrifying combo!

292
00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.430
He's almost like...

293
00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:05.000
...an arrow!

294
00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:09.440
Punk Attack!

295
00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.120
Zoro!

296
00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:26.830
It connects! Direct hit!

297
00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:31.220
Note that deaths in Groggy Ring are
to be expected and are of no concern.

298
00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:33.220
So... dizzy...

299
00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:36.800
Team Foxy isn't ready to stop its attack yet!

300
00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:38.500
Human...

301
00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:40.840
Cannon!

302
00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.330
Ugh... I feel sick...

303
00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.780
The spiked shoulder protector draws near!

304
00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:47.200
Sanji! Get out of the way!

305
00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.260
Sling Tackle!

306
00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:55.250
They're setting up Sanji the ball man now!

307
00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:58.650
Size Attack: S!

308
00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:03.830
Hamburg sends him flying back!
They're not preparing to score at all!

309
00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:04.280
M!

310
00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:08.990
L!

311
00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:16.640
The Groggy Monsters unleash a spectacular team attack!

312
00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:19.440
That's just terrible...

313
00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:21.230
Zoro!

314
00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:24.080
Sanji!

315
00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:31.610
Looks like Team Straw Hat
isn't getting up from this!

316
00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:32.950
Piece o' cake!

317
00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:37.790
The opponents literally are "groggy"!

318
00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:42.330
All that remains now is to stuff
the ball man into his ring coffin,

319
00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:45.570
and this will be two wins in a row!

320
00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:50.250
The undefeated Groggy Monsters
are supremely powerful!

321
00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.940
We win again!

322
00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.990
Hey cook...

323
00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:01.040
Lend me a hand for ten seconds...

324
00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:07.780
Sounds like... a reasonable length of time...

325
00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.510
Hey! Look!

326
00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:12.530
Wha...?!

327
00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:16.900
They're up! Team Straw Hat is standing again!

328
00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:22.450
Roronoa the swordsman and Sanji
the cook are terrifyingly tough!

329
00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:25.080
They really know how to make a game exciting!

330
00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.820
They're back up! Now get those jerks!

331
00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:36.990
But do these two have
enough strength left to fight?!

332
00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:39.190
Hey you guys...

333
00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.600
One Monster Burger please!

334
00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:51.420
Wh-What?!

335
00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:52.420
What could that mean?

336
00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:57.940
Our boss has just ordered a Monster Burger!

337
00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:21.930
Hold on! They're clearly using weapons now!

338
00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:24.400
Grind 'em up like a burger patty...

339
00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:27.110
And slice 'em good like fresh pickles...

340
00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:28.570
Who are the guests?!

341
00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:31.540
Green lettuce... and yellow cheese!

342
00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:36.330
Crush it all between big pans and you get...

343
00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:41.760
...a Monster Burger!

344
00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:46.520
There it is! Their utterly
horrific triple weapon attack!

345
00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:53.760
There's no escape! Foul play
like this clearly calls for red cards!

346
00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:56.970
Team Straw Hat is in a tough bind!

347
00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:04.410
Oh, but wouldn't you know!

348
00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:10.070
The ref just happens to have
his back turned as he stretches!

349
00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.950
What are you doing?!

350
00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:12.920
Stop Luffy!

351
00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:13.810
But...!

352
00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:16.490
They want us to butt in!

353
00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.220
We need to grin and bear it Luffy!

354
00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:24.660
Everything's set! The Groggy
Monsters commence their attack!

355
00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:28.430
Whatever happens now don't blame me!

356
00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:31.680
Naturally they go after Sanji the ball man!

357
00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:37.940
Will he be ground up sliced
and crushed into a hamburger patty?!

358
00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:44.200
I can't make much with
third-rate ingredients like you guys

359
00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:46.580
but I'll cook each and every one of you!

360
00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:49.120
You're mincemeat now!

361
00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:51.120
Troisième...
Third Rate

362
00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:51.920
He's fast!

363
00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:52.920
...Haché!
Mincemeat

364
00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:09.470
Bouquetiere...
Mixed Vegetables

365
00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:11.260
...Shot!

366
00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:19.020
Oh no!

367
00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:21.290
Stop crushing!

368
00:22:24.640 --> 00:22:26.090
Leader!

369
00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:34.410
How dare you...?!

370
00:22:40.260 --> 00:22:42.840
Don't forget this is a team battle.

371
00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:45.380
Why you...!

372
00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:48.380
I'll cut you up!

373
00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:52.050
No-Sword Style...

374
00:22:53.320 --> 00:22:54.890
...Dragon

375
00:22:55.610 --> 00:22:57.630
...Twister

376
00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:08.820
M-My word! Big Pan has fallen
victim to Pickles' spinning blades!

377
00:23:09.850 --> 00:23:13.340
Oh no! Dammit...!

378
00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:19.040
Bad Manner...

379
00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.680
...Kick Course!

380
00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:32.570
I-Incredible!

381
00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:36.330
The gigantic Big Pan was falling over
but is now upright again!

382
00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:42.030
A tremendous kick has kept
Big Pan on his feet and in a daze!

383
00:23:42.030 --> 00:23:45.500
Oh! Now Zoro the swordsman charges in!

384
00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:49.410
Naturally he's going after
Big Pan the ball man!

385
00:23:50.050 --> 00:23:51.740
You're not getting past me!

386
00:24:00.520 --> 00:24:03.620
I've had enough of you and the ref!

387
00:24:03.940 --> 00:24:08.590
The crowd-- no the referee-- takes a direct hit!

388
00:24:09.640 --> 00:24:12.690
That was on purpose...!

389
00:24:12.690 --> 00:24:15.630
How dare he... hurt the ref...?!

390
00:24:15.630 --> 00:24:18.270
Red card!

391
00:24:18.580 --> 00:24:20.130
Huh?

392
00:24:20.130 --> 00:24:23.940
My cards and whistle... They're gone...

393
00:24:24.950 --> 00:24:26.280
You're a naughty girl.

394
00:24:27.520 --> 00:24:29.850
Couldn't help it. It's an old habit of mine.

395
00:24:35.670 --> 00:24:37.380
Oh! What's this?!

396
00:24:37.380 --> 00:24:42.860
Is Team Straw Hat arguing again
in front of the lone Big Pan?!

397
00:24:47.560 --> 00:24:51.700
Armée de l'Air Power Shoot!
Air Force Power Shoot

398
00:24:55.470 --> 00:24:57.580
I-Incredible!

399
00:24:57.900 --> 00:24:58.810
The gigantic wotan...

400
00:24:58.980 --> 00:24:59.510
What?!

401
00:24:59.510 --> 00:25:00.180
No way!

402
00:25:00.180 --> 00:25:02.680
Big Pan...

403
00:25:02.680 --> 00:25:05.650
is airborne!

404
00:25:05.650 --> 00:25:07.150
Go!

405
00:25:07.150 --> 00:25:08.990
They're headed for the goal ring!

406
00:25:08.990 --> 00:25:09.990
No!

407
00:25:24.500 --> 00:25:28.440
Goal!

408
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:31.850 line:8% position:5% align:start size:45%
